     "Machine Plates"
    ]
   },
   {
    "p": "Ovens, microwaves and generators show their own controls on a plate, sized to fill the card. The keys and switches on the plate set and run the machine; its display or gauge reads it."
   },
   {
    "p": "An oven or a microwave shows its plate in the *Crafting* tab, at a station. A generator shows its plate in its own card. Table 60-1 lists the plates and where each is shown."
   },
   {
    "table": {
